---
const labelClass = "font-label-stratum font-bold uppercase no-underline";
const containerClass =
	"mx-auto w-[min(1240px,calc(100%-clamp(40px,8vw,128px)))] max-[680px]:w-[calc(100%-40px)]";
const eyebrowClass =
	"eyebrow m-0 text-[clamp(9px,0.72vw,11px)] tracking-[0.2em] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.58)]";
---

<section
	class="solutions relative overflow-hidden scroll-mt-[clamp(88px,8vw,112px)] border-t border-[rgba(232,209,203,0.14)] bg-[#04070d] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_82%_8%,rgba(232,209,203,0.055),transparent_34%)] pt-[clamp(72px,9.5vw,148px)] pb-[clamp(56px,7vw,104px)] text-cream"
	id="nosotros"
	aria-labelledby="nosotros-title"
>
	<div
		class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(232,209,203,0.028)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(232,209,203,0.028)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[length:88px_88px] [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,transparent,#000_18%,#000_82%,transparent)]"
		aria-hidden="true"
	></div>
	<div class:list={[containerClass, "relative"]}>
		<div
			class="intro grid grid-cols-[minmax(160px,0.52fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)] gap-[clamp(36px,6vw,104px)] border-b border-[rgba(232,209,203,0.14)] pb-[clamp(48px,7vw,94px)] max-[1020px]:grid-cols-1 max-[1020px]:gap-[22px]"
		>
			<div
				class="intro-meta flex flex-col justify-between gap-7 pt-[0.5em] max-[1020px]:flex-row max-[1020px]:items-center"
			>
				<p class:list={[labelClass, eyebrowClass]}>LA EMPRESA</p>
				<p
					class:list={[
						labelClass,
						"meta-line m-0 text-[clamp(8.5px,0.66vw,10px)] tracking-[0.16em] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.38)]",
					]}>BUENOS AIRES · ARGENTINA</p
				>
			</div>
			<div class="intro-copy">
				<h2
					class="mb-[clamp(24px,3vw,40px)] mt-0 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(34px,5.1vw,78px)] font-normal uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.035em]"
					id="nosotros-title"
				>
					Construimos herramientas para <span class="text-white">trabajo real</span>.
				</h2>
				<p
					class="mb-[1em] mt-0 max-w-[58ch] text-[clamp(14.5px,1.08vw,18px)] leading-[1.68] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.62)] last:mb-0"
				>
					Vesla nace de una idea simple: el software tiene que sacarte trabajo de encima,
					no agregarte otro sistema que aprender. Diseñamos productos que resuelven
					problemas concretos de operación, ventas, empleo y gestión.
				</p>
				<p
					class="mb-[1em] mt-0 max-w-[58ch] text-[clamp(14.5px,1.08vw,18px)] leading-[1.68] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.62)] last:mb-0"
				>
					Trabajamos con equipos que necesitan ordenar procesos, automatizar tareas
					repetitivas o construir una plataforma desde cero. Sin promesas grandilocuentes:
					alcance claro, entregas visibles y código que se puede mantener.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div
			class="stats grid grid-cols-3 border-b border-[rgba(232,209,203,0.14)] max-[680px]:grid-cols-1"
			aria-label="Vesla en números"
		>
			<div class="stat flex flex-col gap-[10px] border-r border-[rgba(232,209,203,0.14)] px-[clamp(18px,2.6vw,38px)] py-[clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px)] first:pl-0 last:border-r-0 max-[680px]:flex-row max-[680px]:items-baseline max-[680px]:justify-between max-[680px]:border-b max-[680px]:border-r-0 max-[680px]:px-0 max-[680px]:py-5 max-[680px]:last:border-b-0">
				<span
					class="stat-num font-label-stratum text-[clamp(24px,2.6vw,40px)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[0.02em]"
					>06</span
				>
				<span
					class:list={[
						labelClass,
						"stat-lbl text-[clamp(8.5px,0.66vw,10px)] tracking-[0.16em] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.42)]",
					]}>PRODUCTOS</span
				>
			</div>
			<div class="stat flex flex-col gap-[10px] border-r border-[rgba(232,209,203,0.14)] px-[clamp(18px,2.6vw,38px)] py-[clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px)] last:border-r-0 max-[680px]:flex-row max-[680px]:items-baseline max-[680px]:justify-between max-[680px]:border-b max-[680px]:border-r-0 max-[680px]:px-0 max-[680px]:py-5 max-[680px]:last:border-b-0">
				<span
					class="stat-num font-label-stratum text-[clamp(24px,2.6vw,40px)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[0.02em]"
					>100%</span
				>
				<span
					class:list={[
						labelClass,
						"stat-lbl text-[clamp(8.5px,0.66vw,10px)] tracking-[0.16em] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.42)]",
					]}>A MEDIDA O INTEGRADO</span
				>
			</div>
			<div class="stat flex flex-col gap-[10px] border-r border-[rgba(232,209,203,0.14)] px-[clamp(18px,2.6vw,38px)] py-[clamp(26px,3.2vw,44px)] last:border-r-0 max-[680px]:flex-row max-[680px]:items-baseline max-[680px]:justify-between max-[680px]:border-b max-[680px]:border-r-0 max-[680px]:px-0 max-[680px]:py-5 max-[680px]:last:border-b-0">
				<span
					class="stat-num font-label-stratum text-[clamp(24px,2.6vw,40px)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[0.02em]"
					>1:1</span
				>
				<span
					class:list={[
						labelClass,
						"stat-lbl text-[clamp(8.5px,0.66vw,10px)] tracking-[0.16em] text-[rgba(232,209,203,0.42)]",
					]}>ACOMPAÑAMIENTO</span
				>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
